  "query_preview": "..\nSuper Typhoon Bavi continues to barrel toward the Marianas this\nevening with the onset of damaging winds expected within the next \ncouple of hours. Conditions will continue to deteriorate thereafter.\nFor additional information on Super Typhoon Bavi please see the \nTropical Systems section. Shower and thunderstorm coverage will \ncontinue to increase as Bavi continues to trek to the west-northwest \nwith widespread, heavy showers and scattered thunderstorms \nanticipated overnight. Scattered to numerous, locally heavy, showers \nthroughout the day have helped to moisten soils and infiltration \ncapacity may be limited in some areas to handle additional rainfall. \nAny additional infiltration capacity will be quickly overwhelmed in \ntraining showers and thunderstorms. Localized flooding will be \npossible this evening and overnight.",
